{"speciesId":883,"names":{"fr":"Hydragla","es":"Arctovish","en":"Arctovish","ja":"ウオチルドン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il gèle les alentours pour capturer ses proies, mais comme sa bouche est sur le dessus de sa tête, il a beaucoup de mal à les manger."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Atrapa a sus presas congelando su entorno, pero la ubicación de la boca encima de la cabeza le genera dificultades para deglutirlas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Though it’s able to capture prey by freezing its surroundings, it has trouble eating the prey afterward because its mouth is on top of its head."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"周囲を 凍りつかせて 獲物を 捕まえるが 口が 頭の 上に あるので 食べづらい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Aucune attaque ne pouvait égratigner la peau de son visage, mais il s’est éteint, car il avait du mal à respirer."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Aunque la piel de su rostro era capaz de resistir cualquier ataque, su dificultad para respirar acabó provocando su extinción."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The skin on its face is impervious to attack, but breathing difficulties made this Pokémon go extinct anyway."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"どんな 攻撃にも 傷つかない 面の皮を もつが 呼吸が 不自由だったため 絶滅した。"}],"varieties":[{"id":883,"moves":[{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[20,"level-up",28]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[20,"level-up",77],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"waterfall","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rock-slide","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"super-fang","learns":[[20,"level-up",49]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]}